# Pairs with OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision. A failed status read counts as a
# Commit decision instead of proving nothing.
MODULE: PeerRestoreTrustsUnreadableDecision
TARGET: OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an own-saga commit whose coordinator decision cannot be read is treated as decided
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
read == IF readOk THEN decision ELSE "unreadable"
        auth == IF up
--- REPLACE
read == IF readOk THEN decision ELSE "commit"
        auth == IF up
--- END
